"Slides up from the bottom, in the same window. <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+`</kbd> opens another one."

#: devtox/about.py:89
msgid ""
"<code>dx open</code> apre una tab, <code>dx tabs</code> le elenca, <code>dx mem</code> mostra la memoria."
msgstr ""
"<code>dx open</code> opens a tab, <code>dx tabs</code> lists them, <code>dx mem</code> shows memory use."

#: devtox/about.py:98
msgid ""
"Le altre scorciatoie sono nella pagina iniziale. Puoi cambiare le scelte in <a href=\"devtox://setup\">devtox://setup</a>; versioni, percorsi e licenza sono in <a href=\"devtox://about\">devtox://about</a>."
msgstr ""
"The other shortcuts are on the start page. You can change your choices in <a href=\"devtox://setup\">devtox://setup</a>; versions, paths and license are in <a href=\"devtox://about\">devtox://about</a>."

